| Store | Good for | Not for |
|---|---|---|
| localStorage. | small preferences. | secrets, tokens, big data. |
| sessionStorage. | one tab's temporary state. | anything that must survive the tab. |
| IndexedDB. | larger structured, async data. | secrets. |
| server. | the source of truth. | offline-only drafts. |

